From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:13:20 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 010/207] sessions: discard unindexed files on fresh serving
 boot

Port mikolaj92's PR #37 and issue #36 restart-accumulation diagnosis, with Jenpo's independent corroboration. Purge only owned regular disposable files under an exclusive namespace lock before workers start. Keep generic persistent reconciliation explicit and resolve the original lean findings through a small helper. Host tests cover unknown directory types, foreign and peer preservation, exclusion and failure propagation.
